sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger the CSMS to send an InstallCertificateRequest<br>with certificateType CSMSRootCertificate

    CSMS->>CS: InstallCertificateRequest (certificateType = CSMSRootCertificate, certificate)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: certificateType must be CSMSRootCertificate<br>certificate contains <A certificate>

    CS-->>CSMS: InstallCertificateResponse (status = Failed)
